<!--
  BigFix Fixlet Export

  Title    : Take Registry Ownership and configure DCOM permissions for RunTimeBroker AppID {9CA88EE3-ACB7-47c8-AFC4-AB702511C276} (Win10/2016) (TEST!!!) (export)
  ID       : 25565
  Author   : JasonWalker
  Domain   : BESC
  Imported : 2018-11-08T14:52:33
